{number: 169}
{title: Were You There?}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Were you there when they crucified my Lord?
Were you [F] there when they crucified my [C] Lord?
Oh, [Am] sometimes it [F] causes me to [C] tremble, [G7] tremble, [Am] tremble;
[C] Were you there when they [F] crucified my [C] Lord?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Were you there when they nailed Him to the tree?
Were you [F] there when they nailed Him to the [C] tree?
Oh, [Am] sometimes it [F] causes me to [C] tremble, [G7] tremble, [Am] tremble;
[C] Were you there when they [F] nailed Him to the [C] tree?
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Were you there when they laid Him in the tomb?
Were you [F] there when they laid Him in the [C] tomb?
Oh, [Am] sometimes it [F] causes me to [C] tremble, [G7] tremble, [Am] tremble;
[C] Were you there when they [F] laid Him in the [C] tomb?
{end_of_verse}
